TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution into acidic Cu-Ba solution; report SI(Witherite) at step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 30 charge
    -water 1

# Built-in Calcite kinetics; use specific surface area=1, and scale to mimic rate constant=10
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10 0.6
        -steps 10 in 100
        -tol 1e-10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
    -si Witherite
END
